00:05:11,250 --> 00:05:17,250
Berkshire County is a horror, thriller film directed by Audrey Cummings.

3
00:07:46,875 --> 00:07:52,875
Kylie Winters, a bullied and self-loathing teen, reluctantly agrees to
babysit at an isolated country mansion on Halloween night.

4
00:10:22,500 --> 00:10:28,500
When a small boy in a pig mask appears at the door trick-or-treating, Kylie's
night transforms into a horrifying and violent cat-and-mouse game.

5
00:12:58,125 --> 00:13:04,125
She must go beyond what she ever thought possible if she
and the children are to survive the night.

6
